 ### UI (In-game)
 
 - **Worker recommendation highlights disabled**: turned off tile coloring for "worker-recommended plot to improve" (in `CvGame::updateColoredPlots` within `CvGameInterface.cpp`). Reasons: (1) avoids extra computation in both debug ([see for related info this autoplay info](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/Modding_Ressources/README.md#how-to-autoplay-let-the-ai-play-for-you-super-fast-gameplay--testing-tool-in-map-loaded-save-file-new-game-etc-view)) and normal play; (2) our worker logic now relies on `CvUnitAI::AI_bestCityBuild`, so the vanilla highlight often disagrees and can mislead; (3) the highlight was easily confused with **city site** recommendations. City-site suggestions remain enabled and intentionally prominent; in practice, they frequently pick **strong** locations—quite often as good as, or better than, typical manual choices. See [Settlers (AI)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Main_Changes_Guide.md#settlers-ai). *Note:* the **displayed recommended settle city plots** don’t always match what the AI would settle if it were playing your civ in autoplay; the UI hint path may be (not sure) using a different logic from the reworked/optimized `AIFoundValue::evaluate`. Treat them as general information, not guarantees.
-- (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5517+) **Reorganized advisors**. For example, **merged the espionage screen into the Foreign Advisor**, and **merged the Economic Advisor's Finance Tab into the Domestic Advisor**, the **Economic Advisor's Environment Tab into the Info Screen**, the **Religion** Advisor so it is now **a tab** in the new **Policy Advisor**; so they are now tabs of these instead (deleted the old now obsolete lone advisor .py files). (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5524+) Rearrange Advisor **keyboard shortcuts** (in [CIV4ControlInfos.xml](/Assets/XML/Units/CIV4ControlInfos.xml) and DLL files like [CvEnums.h](/CvGameCoreDLL/CvEnums.h), [CvEnums.h](/CvGameCoreDLL/CvEnums.h), [CvGameInterface.cpp](/CvGameCoreDLL/CvGameInterface.cpp), and [CyEnumsInterface.cpp](/CvGameCoreDLL/CyEnumsInterface.cpp)) and adjust the **order of advisor buttons** in map view and **Sevopedia shortcuts** corresponding text (e.g., move Victory screen to F9 and Info Screen to F8 so the Info Screen is easier to split to F7 and F8 later on and so layout is **more logically organized** from internal to external advisors).
+- (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5517+) **Reorganized advisors**. For example, **merged the espionage screen into the Foreign Advisor**, and **merged the Economic Advisor's Finance Tab into the Domestic Advisor**, the **Economic Advisor's Environment Tab into the Info Screen**, the **Religion** Advisor and **Corporation** Advisor (so it is always visible and easier to access) into the new **Policy Advisor**; so they are now tabs of these instead (deleted the old now obsolete lone advisor .py files). (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5524+) Rearrange Advisor **keyboard shortcuts** (in [CIV4ControlInfos.xml](/Assets/XML/Units/CIV4ControlInfos.xml) and DLL files like [CvEnums.h](/CvGameCoreDLL/CvEnums.h), [CvEnums.h](/CvGameCoreDLL/CvEnums.h), [CvGameInterface.cpp](/CvGameCoreDLL/CvGameInterface.cpp), and [CyEnumsInterface.cpp](/CvGameCoreDLL/CyEnumsInterface.cpp)) and adjust the **order of advisor buttons** in map view and **Sevopedia shortcuts** corresponding text (e.g., move Victory screen to F9 and Info Screen to F8 so the Info Screen is easier to split to F7 and F8 later on and so layout is **more logically organized** from internal to external advisors).
 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5521+) **Expand** and most **advisors** so they scale to **game resolution dynamically** instead of hardcoded advisor screen dimensions. The code was also refactored to improve **dynamic scaling**, ensuring **most UI elements automatically realign** if dimensions are changed. Advisors are now **excentered** so **overall more information** is displayed, thus **reducing the need for scrolling**, while still **preserving key relevant information** for display (scoreboard, map, commerce sliders and values, etc.). Some of their dimensions are **harmonized**. Note: some **right space for scoreboard** and **top space for the top bars** of the main interface was made (since commerce sliders are now as of now on the right side, they don't need left space anymore). See [Main Advisors reworks](/README.md#main-advisors-reworks-eg-score-tab-history-tab-in-the-info-screen-advisor)
 - **Beautified** the **Domestic Advisor**: now shows the **button (i.e. icon) of the current item being built** (unit, building, project, process) in "Producing" column. (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5522+) Use the **shared advisor shell layout** (**top/bottom bars** + single content panel, remove the old exit icon) so Domestic Advisor **mirrors other advisors' structure** instead of a floating table, now using a **clearer constrast dark yellow theme** instead. Make the advisor be a tab as the **Overview** tab. Change in [CvDomesticAdvisor.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvDomesticAdvisor.py).
 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5522+) **Beautified** the **Policy Advisor**: enlarge **top panels text** so **long civic names don't overflow**. Change in [CvPolicyAdvisorScreen.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvPolicyAdvisorScreen.py).

